      "content": "That's a decent start, but I'm worried it's a bit thin. The automated screening tool is pretty strict—if we don't hit a high score on that keyword fraction, we won't even make it to the humans.\n\nCan you expand this into a much more detailed and comprehensive section? We need more depth on the actual mechanics of the reforestation. Just make sure you keep that keyword score high so we pass the bot, but keep it professional so it doesn't look like we're just trying to trick the system. Try to make it more robust.",
